      "poi_id": "p18",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "A quiet Buddha shrine on the way down from Bà Nà. Good spot to slow down and let the incense settle the mind."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p17",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "That golden bridge with the giant stone hands — hold your camera steady, the clouds like to photobomb."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p23",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Fish cake noodles in a light, peppery broth. Slurp loud, it tastes better that way."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p1",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": "m1",
      "note": "Caves, pagodas and a climb with a view. The stone steps are steep, so take it slow and enjoy the carvings."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p25",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "A sit-down spot with plenty of green things on the menu. Good place to rest the legs after the Marble Mountains."
